Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Method B training + annotation-free readout-inference
 diagnosis (TASK1/2/3)

- TASK2: offline diagnosis (clusters, anchor_decorrelate, caption_proto, unsup 2-means
  vs oracle naming) shows naming is the dead-knot; no annotation-free inference readout
  beats baseline. New: src/utils/readout_decorrelate.py, scripts/build_sibling_clusters.py,
  scripts/analyze_readout_inference.py, scripts/task2_per_cluster.py; anchor_decorrelate
  readout mode added to language_module.
- TASK3: confirmed Segment3D mask provenance; axes accounting.
- TASK1: 8-card NCCL Method B training healthy; native epoch-1 metrics captured;
  final-ckpt three-tier eval staged via scripts/phase4_autoeval.sh (GPU-gated).
- Fixed-koujing fg-mIoU self-check OK (0.15475); reports under error_analysis/reports.
